OL,3,GNEWSA'Why I still empty bins at 82'
OL,4,
OL,5,FOne of Britain's oldest and
OL,6,Flongest-serving bin men says he still
OL,7,Fgets "a buzz" out of his job after 50
OL,8,Fyears of service.
OL,10,FAt 82, John Wesbroom, from Woodcote,
OL,11,FOxfordshire, clocks up 45 hours a week
OL,12,Fworking for waste firm Biffa and says
OL,13,Fhe would recommend the job to anyone.
OL,15,FThe grandfather says he enjoys keeping
OL,16,Ffit, talking to the people he serves
OL,17,Fand seeing "the real side of life".
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
